Input file for GB binding free energy calculation + per-residue decomposition.
Trajectory: nstxout-compressed=5000 steps x dt=2fs = 10ps/frame, ~10000 frames
over the full 100ns. Only the last 20ns (post-equilibration window) is used,
not the full trajectory -- frames 8001-10000
= t=80-100ns, sampled every 100ps (interval=10 frames) -> 200 frames analyzed.
&general
  startframe=8001, endframe=10000, interval=10,
  verbose=2, keep_files=0,
  PBRadii=2,
/
&gb
  igb=5, saltcon=0.150,
/
&decomp
  idecomp=2, dec_verbose=0,
  print_res="within 6",
/
